00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.000
Oh, hey, Wrigley's friend.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hi!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.640
Lucy.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.070
